 v2.3.1 was live in us-east, us-west and eu-west, failing health checks with an 18% error rate.\n- **Rollback:** I went back to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. I skipped v2.3.1-rc because it had only been healthy in staging, not production.\n- **Check afterward:** all three regions are running v2.3.0, health checks pass and the error rate is about 0.2%.\n- **Incident:** INC-0001 describes the failure and the rollback. It also says the cause of the v2.3.1 failure needs to be found before v2.3.1 is deployed again.", "type": "text"}]}]}